  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.0\n      - Initial upgrade to netstandard2.1\n      - Added aml checking integration events\n      - Added UploaderRole to TransactionDocumentUploadedIntegrationEvent\n      - added referred by user id to UserRegisteredIntegrationEvent\n      - added TrustlyReportsUploadedIntegrationEvent\n      - added WalletCommissionChangedIntegrationEvent\n      - added ReferredBy user details to UserRegisteredIntegrationEvent\n      - added UserLanguageChangedIntegrationEvent\n      - added UserDefaultEmailChangedIntegrationEvent\n      - added StaffFundsChangedIntegrationEvent\n      - added RegistrationId to RedirectRegistrationIntegrationEvent\n      - added CardPaymentReceivedIntegrationEvent\n      - added ValrAccountCreatedIntegrationEvent\n      - added Atm service events\n      - added transaction id to wallet credited and debited events\n      - added RequestedAt date time to AtmOperationRequestedIntegrationEvent\n      - added transactionReference to AtmOperationRequestedIntegrationEvent\n      - added AtmDepositAmountExceededIntegrationEvent\n      - added POS integration events\n      - added EIdAuthenticatedIntegrationEvent\n      - added Wallet Bank Cashout integration events\n      - added UserAccountCreatedIntegrationEvent",
